&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: IT Support Contractor &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; IT Operations Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London office (hybrid. 3 days in office)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract type:&lt;/strong&gt; day rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Systemiq is looking for a Level 1 IT Support Contractor to provide first-line technical support to staff. The role covers day-to-day IT support tasks currently handled by the team, including hardware setup, ticket triage, and office technology support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to and resolve first-line IT support tickets, escalating complex issues to Level 2 or 3 as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and configure laptops, monitors, and other hardware for new starters and existing staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support office print infrastructure, including troubleshooting printers and managing print queues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage user account requests, such as password resets and access changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate records of support requests and resolutions in the ticketing system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding and offboarding processes, including account creation and equipment provisioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide basic support for common software tools and internal systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and maintain office wifi, including troubleshooting connectivity issues and liaising with the network provider where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep IT policy documents up to date and aligned with the International Organization for Standardization&#39;s ISO 27001 information security standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide remote support to staff in other Systemiq offices, resolving issues where possible and escalating on-site work to local contacts as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate recurring or systemic issues to the IT Operations Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and experience required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a first-line IT support or helpdesk role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Windows 11&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Microsoft Office 365 and Microsoft Entra ID (formerly Azure AD), including user and access management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with common office hardware (printers, monitors, laptops) and basic network troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of information security standards, ideally ISO 27001&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a customer-focused approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritise and manage multiple requests at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ticketing systems (e.g. ServiceNow, solarwinds) is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;description__body&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
